# Kipuka EST — CSR Attributes (RFC 7030 §4.5)
Output docs/gifs/03-est-csrattrs.mp4
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 30ms
Set Shell "bash"

Type "# EST CSR Attributes — kipuka-rsa.cert-lab.local (RFC 7030 §4.5)"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "./lab est-csrattrs -p rsa"
Enter
Sleep 4s
